// のりかえ案内 (trying it out locally, 2026-09-28): after three sections in a row answered with the same button, suggest another button (the one unused longest) once, with このまま to stay. Counted only while the page is open, per person; nothing is saved. ?norikae=1 suggests it after every section, for trying it out.
