// きゅうけい (2026-09-29): after 30 minutes of play in a row (per person, set in おうちの方へ), the rest screen comes when a section ends and stays until the rest is over (15 minutes); a reload or another launch shows it again. A little note comes 5 minutes before. Time is counted between taps (core.js restTick) and kept apart from the record. ほかの 人に かわる lets someone else play; an adult can end the rest with a check sum. ?kyukei=1 makes a minute 2 seconds, for trying it out.
